"Memory-Tech"},{"animation":false,"id":777,"name":"Hakuhodo DY Music & Pictures"}],"synopsis":{"language":null,"source":"anilist","spoiler":false,"text":"Five years ago, something horrifying happened on Kamioki Island. Something so nightmarish that it stripped all memory from Mari Wakatake's mind even as it left every other human on the island dead in its wake! Now enrolled against her will at an isolated girl's academy, Mari is unaware that hidden eyes are watching her, waiting for her memory to return.\n\nBuried in her psyche is the most terrifying secret of all: while Mari was the only human who lived, she may not have been the only survivor! As something in a female skin invades Kaihou Academy, Mari's only hope may lie in a strange girl to whom she is inexplicably drawn yet cannot trust.\n\n(Source: Sentai Filmworks)"},"tags":[{"name":"LGBTQ+ Themes","rank":100,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Yuri","rank":92,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Coming of Age","rank":90,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Female Protagonist","rank":84,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Aliens","rank":80,"spoiler":true},{"name":"Coastal","rank":79,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Amnesia","rank":76,"spoiler":false},{"name":"School","rank":75,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Primarily Female Cast","rank":75,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Tragedy","rank":70,"spoiler":true},{"name":"Kuudere","rank":60,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Military","rank":60,"spoiler":true},{"name":"Space","rank":52,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Shounen","rank":20,"spoiler":false}],"titles":{"display":"Blue Drop","english":"Blue Drop","native":"BLUE DROP ～天使達の戯曲～","romaji":"BLUE DROP: Tenshi-tachi no Gikyoku","synonyms":[{"language":"zh","source":"bangumi","value":"BLUE DROP 天使们的戏曲"}]},"trailer":null,"visibility":"general"}